+# Public demo v3.6.2 · undo and MYR purchase prices
+
+This update preserves the existing Netlify site, Google browser OAuth client, visitor-owned Runpod integration, Meta WhatsApp and 360dialog personal sandbox interfaces. No owner API keys are bundled.
+
+- Undo restores the exact most recent successful simulated sale once. It invalidates current suggestions and outward actions while preserving historical approved drafts. It does not retract messages or Gmail drafts already created.
+- Purchase quotes are optional, folded under assistant settings. Quotes in this demonstration are explicitly marked demo. Unknown prices remain null. Amounts use integer MYR cents and whole-package purchase rounding; suggested/approved ingredient quantities remain visible in base units.
+- Editing prices, stock, weather or holiday conditions invalidates old outward previews. Approvals save an immutable price snapshot. Gmail drafts are never sent automatically; WhatsApp requires an exact preview and separate explicit send. Runpod is an optional paid review with visitor-owned credentials and explicit approval.
+- The 20-product forecast remains a declared synthetic menu mix scaled by the existing synthetic weather/holiday model. This release does not claim real sales training or remote inference for local suggestions.
+- Visitor stock, prices and undo history are saved in this browser tab only. Credentials are excluded from sessionStorage, localStorage, public files and logs.
+
+Check: node --test tests/*.test.mjs tests/whatsapp_ui_contract_test.mjs
+
+Deployment: retain the three Netlify Functions and the existing production origin https://www.cafe-replenishment-demo.com. Static file upload alone does not update Functions.
